    "title": "Tentative FHSAA football classifications now available - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mike Ridaught ,\n1 days ago The Florida High School Athletic Association released tentative football classifications for 2026-27 and 2027-28, with an appeal period ending December 17. Buchholz High dropped from Class 6A to 5A-District 3, joining Belleview, Matanzas, and others for upcoming seasons. On Monday, the Florida High School Athletic Association (FHSAA) released the ‘tentative’... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
